{"arm_set":{"arm_ids":["baseline"],"factor":"baseline"},"observed_runtime_image_digest":"sha256:51ed5ccdfb6fcebd23ab7065a870d60dff4631e619846c7c8872ce79896ba7ac","routing_config_digest":null,"scenarios":[{"arms":[{"arm_id":"baseline","negative_patches":["sha256:ac72c29ec8297fa75b99db09b855c6bb2bc9e8f385f436a8b52908aa16913cb7","sha256:cb13221c4e519cd775fcc9141dbb1307e01e2ba791781b83866e81c3a550c4e4","sha256:f737d631142735263b19bd13903d094f3803d0dd41ae02ef6b0e8363ef706b79"],"qualification":{"baseline_passes":{"evidence":"sha256:db073e5d55b47cc7065e63f818502702ac0406b5bcbdb68289c407548b5f9a34","outcome":"passed"},"feature_fails":{"evidence":"sha256:f9d3478cbbaadf69de64de95e4e8f2034f6ced7165a3b05454d4c57e54fbdbac","outcome":"failed"},"reference_passes":{"evidence":"sha256:4b9fac901946a42fa9551909f38065df21675f95d1dbd1271f969b672a1c3775","outcome":"passed"}},"reference_patch":"sha256:9ef3a8f1b2911b9247f739b55a703e9f53265385c7ea87a996b66d39a9806289","task_prompt":"# Let reviewers take their time over gated artifacts\n\nThis repository is `oakridge-dbos`, Oakridge's DBOS workflow engine, at the root of an\nOakridge checkout. A stage runs one execution workflow per unit\n(`artifactContractExecutionWorkflow` in `oakridge-dbos/src/workflows/executor-topology.ts`),\ncoordinated by `productionStageWorkflow` in `production-topology.ts`. The execution starts an\nagent session through its executor adapter, receives the artifacts the agent emits, and holds\ngated outputs at their approval gate until a reviewer decides.\n\n## The problem\n\nAn execution returns as soon as the terminal observer reports that its executor has ended. If\nthe agent emitted an artifact into an approval gate and its session then ended, the execution\nhas already returned with that output missing by the time the reviewer gets to it. The stage\ncoordinator fails the unit with `required_output_missing`, and the reviewer's approval is\ndelivered to a workflow that is no longer listening, so the artifact is never released.\n\nReviewers work at human pace, and an agent session usually ends long before the review does.\n\n## What to change\n\n1. An artifact emitted into a gate or a handoff can still be approved after its agent's session\n   has ended. That approval releases the artifact and completes the unit, exactly as an approval\n   given while the session was still up would.\n2. When the agent's session ends and an output the unit owes has never been emitted, the unit\n   fails as missing output promptly, as it does now. It does not wait on reviews of the unit's\n   other outputs first, since the unit cannot be satisfied.\n3. Everything else about executions, gates, handoffs and the stage coordinator behaves as\n   before.\n\nAdd tests for the new behaviour next to the existing ones in `oakridge-dbos/tests/`.\n","tree_digest":"sha256:5ddeec81787ce675a135100e82dcd4ed418121640e032b88c2573ef47c01631c"}],"checkpoint_sha":"71edf9d5a16281102301381f7094432e4bfadfdc","dependency_lock_digests":{},"excluded_paths":[],"feature_request":"Let reviewers take their time over gated artifacts","hidden_tests":[{"digest":"sha256:faa74547fc0d42b5666e6d3a18063ea38e32d7db6a2c57d25026304ae6a9750f","name":"hidden_regression"},{"digest":"sha256:0f3ede5b8728caa51ebb4e1b75782eb0dbfeb8f267681c519a7aa07ad08265bd","name":"new_behavior"}],"included_paths":["oakridge-core/examples/dev_flow_v11.json","oakridge-dbos/README.md","oakridge-dbos/package.json","oakridge-dbos/src/adapters/kbbl.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/compiler/compile-workflow.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/compiler/materialize-stage.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/compiler/materialize-units.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/compiler/resolve-execution.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/compiler/select-resume-stages.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/contracts/evaluate-artifacts.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/dev/run-gate-proof.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/dev/run-handoff-proof.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/dev/run-kbbl-proof.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/dev/run-production-topology-proof.ts","oakridge-dbos/src/dev/run-stu